From 74d51e0cde0c4e5d6add01581cfdc196601bd1dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Meng Li <Meng.Li@windriver.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Jul 2025 13:44:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] t23x: overlay: create a overlay dts to support for booting
 NVIDIA Orin AGX platform directly

So far, NVIDIA Yocto SDK only supports for loading dtb from configuration
table of uefi firmware. The reason is as below:
During deploying images onto board, the NVIDIA burn script concatenates
that basic dtb and overlay dtbo files one by one at the end of uefi with
4k bytes alignment. During booting system, uefi image gets the dtb and
dtbo files, and then create a full feature dtb, and then modify some dts
node based on specific board, and then register it into configuration
table. When kernel boots up, the full feature dtb will be passed into
kernel. Based on this kind of booting mode, it needs to spend on more
than 20 minutes to burn the whole sysyem image even if user wants to
update kernel image and dtb. It is very inconvinent and unacceptable burn
the whole system image during debugging kernel and dtb. Therefore, in
order to solve this issue, create a overly dts used to improve dtb so that
it is able to be used to boot kernel directly.

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Meng Li <Meng.Li@windriver.com>
---
 overlay/Makefile                              |   1 +
 ...-p3737-0000+p3701-0005-nv-boot-overlay.dts | 201 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 202 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 overlay/tegra234-p3737-0000+p3701-0005-nv-boot-overlay.dts

diff --git a/overlay/Makefile b/overlay/Makefile
index 9528c94..d5e9a0a 100644
--- a/overlay/Makefile
+++ b/overlay/Makefile
@@ -28,6 +28,7 @@ dtbo-y += tegra234-p3737-0000+p3701-0000-audio-respeaker-4-mic-lin-array.dtbo
 dtbo-y += tegra234-p3737-0000+p3701-0000-csi.dtbo
 dtbo-y += tegra234-p3737-0000+p3701-0000-hdr40.dtbo
 dtbo-y += tegra234-p3737-0000+p3701-0000-m2ke.dtbo
+dtbo-y += tegra234-p3737-0000+p3701-0005-nv-boot-overlay.dtbo
 dtbo-y += tegra234-p3767-0000+p3509-a02-audio-adafruit-sph0645lm4h.dtbo
 dtbo-y += tegra234-p3767-0000+p3509-a02-audio-adafruit-uda1334a.dtbo
 dtbo-y += tegra234-p3767-0000+p3509-a02-audio-fe-pi.dtbo
diff --git a/overlay/tegra234-p3737-0000+p3701-0005-nv-boot-overlay.dts b/overlay/tegra234-p3737-0000+p3701-0005-nv-boot-overlay.dts
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..11a4c33
--- /dev/null
+++ b/overlay/tegra234-p3737-0000+p3701-0005-nv-boot-overlay.dts
@@ -0,0 +1,201 @@
